clXau is distributed under the MIT license (section 1).

clXau is a Common Lisp re-implementation of libXau, and xau-lookup-for-display
in src/lookup.lisp follows libxcb's src/xcb_auth.c.  The notices of those
libraries (sections 2 and 3) are kept for the code ported from them.

